    <div class="container legal-page">
      <span class="eyebrow">Rules</span>
      <h1>Pickup &amp; Demolition Rules</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 2 November 2026</p>

      <p>These rules keep every pickup fair and save a wasted journey for both of us. You accept them when you send a pickup or demolition request to Scrap Express.</p>

      <h2>1. Give us true details</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Tell us honestly what the scrap is and roughly how much there is.</li>
        <li>Send real, current photos or videos of this scrap or building, at this site.</li>
        <li>Give the correct site address and a phone number we can reach you on.</li>
        <li>You must own the material, or have permission to sell it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Weight</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The quantity you tell us is only an estimate, used to prepare the quote.</li>
        <li>The <strong>weighbridge slip is the final weight</strong>. You are paid on that weight, not on any other figure.</li>
        <li>Don't add anything to increase the weight, such as water, soil, stones or hidden items. Material like this can be removed before weighing.</li>
        <li>Please let our team load and weigh everything in the open, and keep the weight slip.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Quality</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Our quote is based on the details and photos you send, and the scrap must match them.</li>
        <li>Keep different materials separated as described. Don't hide poor-quality or unwanted material inside a good lot.</li>
        <li>If the quantity or quality at the site is different, we can <strong>change the rate on the spot or refuse that material</strong>.</li>
        <li>You can then accept the new rate or cancel the pickup.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Be ready before the truck comes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Only request a pickup for scrap that really exists. Only tap <strong>My Scrap Is Ready</strong> or tell us it's ready when it is at the site and available to collect.</li>
        <li>We will call you to confirm before sending a truck. Please answer, and tell us straight away if anything has changed.</li>
        <li>Make sure the truck can reach the site, and that someone who can hand over the scrap is there.</li>
        <li>We keep a record of each visit where the promised scrap wasn't available.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Demolition requests</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Rules 1 and 4 also apply to demolition requests and site visits.</li>
        <li>You must own the building or have permission to arrange its demolition.</li>
        <li>Our final quote is given after the site survey.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>Call or WhatsApp us on <a href="tel:+919818826333">+91 98188 26333</a>, or email <a href="mailto:scrapexpress@gmail.com">scrapexpress@gmail.com</a>.</p>
